iative.\n\nReason: Cooperating with the teammate is key. The teammate\'s 10 is a mid-range card; beating it unnecessarily wastes my own strength (J/K) and exposes me to the Landlord immediately. My hand requires multiple entries to clear the singles, so I should save the Rocket for a critical moment and not interfere with my teammate\'s current lead.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
